  "name": "reu_unif",
  "description": "A symbolic security protocol analyzer implemented in Rust, designed to model and verify intruder deduction capabilities within cryptographic environments. The system utilizes Sigma and Cap term representations to execute forward-search algorithms, determining if an attacker can derive sensitive goals from a set of protocol rules and facts. It incorporates custom matching logic for handling cryptographic primitives like pairing and encryption, facilitating formal verification of security properties.",
